<title>JAPAN: Sony to announce changes in management structure.</title>
<headline>Sony to announce changes in management structure.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp said on Wednesday that it would announce &quot;important changes&quot; in its management structure on Thursday.</p>
<p>It plans a news conference at 4.30 p.m. (0730 GMT) on Thursday.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
